'''14th Anniv. Doge Cake''' (14周年記念ケーキわんこ, ''Jūshi Shūnen Kinen Kēki Wanko'', '''14th Anniversary Celebration Cake Doge''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Anniversary|B-Day Gifts]]. It was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 14th Anniv. Doge Cake
|image = E 799.png
|first appearance = [[14 Years of Fun!]]
|money drop = 7¢ - 27¢
}}

==Enemy==
Although it looks tasty, this cake is a lie! Four [[E-793]]s are hiding underneath, attempting to lure in any escaped prisoners. Although it may not look like one, it is actually a Metal enemy.

==Strategy==
[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and any other fast attacking characters such as [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] can kill this enemy very easily. It deals pretty much no damage per hit, so there's no need to worry about it at all.

==Encounters==
